    rdfs:label "Rule-based derivation (slice 11a)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Rule-based reading of the same text (ingest/sira_derive.py, slice 11a), not an AI pass: who is speaking where a claim's words stand (Ibn Isḥāq or Ibn Hishām), the transmission formula of each narration, Ibn Hishām's doubts about poems, and which side a person was on at Badr and Uḥud according to the list Ibn Isḥāq gives them in. Every addition rests on words the text gives, at offsets the full-book pass committed."@en .

